{"word":"fifty-nine","translation":"cinquenta e nove","definition_en":"Being nine more than fifty; the cardinal number between fifty-eight and sixty.","definition_pt":"Sendo nove mais de cinquenta, o número cardinal entre cinquenta e oito e sessenta.","example_en":"There are fifty-nine students in the lecture hall.","example_pt":"Há 59 alunos na sala de aula.","cefr_level":"A1","word_type":"adjective","category_slug":"general-vocabulary","frequency_rank":null},
